REACHABLE (the column exists, the harness fills it, no arvo variant asks):
            setup_ns, first_ns, digest  <- the matrix scaffold constructor;
                                           every arvo variant uses timed!
            score                       <- Routine::score_output / score_dimensions;
                                           implemented by 0 arvo variants
            instructions, cycles        <- --perf-counters, needs sudo on an
                                           Apple-Silicon host (bench-harness/src/perf.rs)

ABSENT    (no column, reaching it is instrument work):
            bytes per element           <- declared by hand in every probe that
                                           weighs storage; no bench measures a size
            accuracy / divergence       <- see the digest and score rows above:
                                           a slot exists, the QUANTITY does not
            compile time                <- schema is entirely runtime fields
